<title>KYRGYZSTAN: Kyrgyz Q1 1997 GDP rose 0.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Kyrgyz Q1 1997 GDP rose 0.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BISHKEK 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kyrgyzstan's gross domestic product in the first three months of this year rose 0.1 percent compared to the same period last year, the National Statistics Committee said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    KYRGYZ GDP		    Jan-Mar 97  Jan-Feb 97  Jan-Mar 96</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change	+0.1	  +0.6	  +2.0</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
